{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"16f6bd5c66f09a42","type":"text","text":"#### Structured format files..\n1. XLSX\n2. XLS\n3. CSV\n4. Relational databases\n5. Parquet\n6. etc..\n#### Unstructured format files..\n1. PDF\n2. JSON\n3. Image\n4. Audio\n5. Video\n6. etc..\n","x":-700,"y":-460,"width":320,"height":480},
		{"id":"433869a7b3f6904f","type":"text","text":"#### Metadata for ELK:\n```json\n{\n\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\", //string data-type\n\"storage_name\": \"<business friendly name>\"\n\"storage_provider\": \"<s3/minio>\", //string data-type\n\"bucket\": \"<name of the bucket>\", //string data-type\n\"uri\": \"<path of the storage>\", //string data-type\n\"file_extension\": \"<file format>\", //string data-type\n\"size_bytes\": \"data size\",  // Integer data-type\n\"dataset_ids\": [\"list of dataset ids\"], // List \n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n}\n```\n\n","x":-360,"y":-460,"width":540,"height":480},
		{"id":"8c9c7459acc1b8ba","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset fields\n(one column inside a dataset)\n```json\n\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"field_name\": \"<column_name>\",\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"sensitivity\": {},\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"field_type\": \"structured\"\n\"field_stats\": {\n\t\"is_unique\": true,\n\t\"is_primary_key\": false,\n\t\"nullable\": true,\n\t\"is_foreign_key\": false,\n\t\"sample_values\": [],\n\t\"data_type\": \"string|integer|decimal|date|timestamp|boolean\",\n\t\"record_counts\": 500,\n\t\"null_counts\": 20\n}\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":860,"y":-460,"width":660,"height":680},
		{"id":"5fd6b6f75a960365","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n### dataset\n```json\n{\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"dataset_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n\"dataset_type\": \"structured\",\n\"layout_type\": \"single_table|multi_sheet\",\n\"file_extension\": \"csv|xlsx|xls|parquet\",\n\"has_header\": true,\n\"schema_version\": 1,\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n}\n```","x":200,"y":-460,"width":620,"height":580},
		{"id":"92f61e1b2e894025","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (structured)\n\n#### dataset relationship\n\n```json\n\"relationship_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"source\": {\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"target\": {\n\t\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"storage_name\": \"<storage name>\",\n\t\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\t\"field_name\": \"<field name>\",\n},\n\"relationship\": \"foreign_key\",\n\"relationship_type\": \"one-to-one\",\n\"confidence_score\": 0.85,\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":1616,"y":-460,"width":524,"height":680},
		{"id":"2c206c8960e4eeaf","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (unstructured)\n### dataset\n```json\n{\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"storage_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"dataset_name\": \"<logical_name>\",\n\"dataset_type\": \"unstructured\",\n\"file_extension\": \"pdf|jpg|mp3|mp4|json\",\n\"layout_type\": \"document|image|audio|video|json\",\n\"schema_version\": 1,\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n}\n```","x":200,"y":160,"width":620,"height":580},
		{"id":"aac5d9cbb034dba0","type":"text","text":"### Metadata for Data (unstructured)\n\n#### dataset fields\n\n```json\n\"field_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"field_name\": \"<invoice_number|face_embedding|transcript_text>\",\n\"dataset_id\": \"<UUID>\",\n\"sensitivity\": {},\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"field_type\": \"unstructured\"\n\"created_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"created_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n\"updated_at\": \"<timestamp>\",\n\"updated_by\": \"\",  //string data-type\n```","x":860,"y":280,"width":660,"height":440}
	],
	"edges":[]
}